{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關本月7日至今（14日）派員到全港多區的香煙零售點「放蛇」試購香煙，發現其中10個零售點懷疑出售私煙，當中包括「白牌煙」。</p><p>行動中，10名店舖負責人或職員被捕。</p><p>海關檢獲約12萬支未完稅香煙。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.576930+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:49:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"9d5f50c2ca66373872965a5e74fcd5f49449fa41193cf6dd4bf812c09f07667c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}